export const README_MD_CONTENT = "# AegisDroid Health - Native Android C++ Device Health Scanner\n\nHigh-performance native Android device health scanner built with C++ NDK, Kotlin Jetpack Compose, and automated GitHub Actions CI/CD artifact building.\n\n## Features\n- **100% Real-Time Battery Diagnostics**: Direct hardware fuel-gauge capacity, temperature, voltage, health status, and charging mode.\n- **Native CPU & Topology**: 64-bit ARM core cluster inspection, governor telemetry, and multicore SIMD matrix benchmark.\n- **Physical Memory (RAM)**: True installed hardware memory and available heap via Android ActivityManager.\n- **Internal Storage**: User data partition mount and commercial flash ROM calculation.\n- **Display Specifications**: Physical screen resolution, density dpi, and dynamic refresh rate (60Hz / 90Hz / 120Hz).\n- **Sensors Inventory**: Probes all onboard hardware sensors (accelerometer, gyroscope, proximity, light, magnetometer).\n- **Custom Adaptive Icon**: Modern green smartphone vector logo on clean white background.\n\n## Build Instructions\nRun `./gradlew assembleDebug` or push to GitHub to trigger automated APK artifact compilation via GitHub Actions.";

